                "message": "✨ Make tabspaces buffer filtering opt-in per tab\n\nC-x b is the regular switch-to-buffer by default. Filtering to the tab's buffers applies in tabs listed in sp-tabs-filtered-tab-names (default Email), in sp-tabs-filtered-modes (mu4e, message), or everywhere with sp-tabs-filter-buffers; a toggle command switches it per tab.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WWLNiD9ebSHChd2mUbx219",
                "tree": {
